<title>HUNGARY: Hungary to sell new tranche of Borsodchem.</title>
<headline>Hungary to sell new tranche of Borsodchem.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1996-10-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hungary's state privatisation agency APV Rt will privately place 1.2 million shares and Global Depositary Receipts (GDRs) in the chemicals maker Borsodchem Rt, Borsodchem said in a statement.</p>
<p>The shares and GDRs will be offered to domestic and foreign institutional investors, the company said.</p>
<p>The papers will not be placed in the U.S., it added.</p>
<p>The subscription price of the papers will be fixed later, Borsodchem said.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom (36 1) 327-4040</p>
</text>
